{
 "_what": "Per-value quality flags for stations_series. Nothing is removed.",
 "_principle": "A flag records a judgement and its evidence. It does NOT enact a removal. Deleting an outlier is an unrecorded decision, and the visible outliers are the only observable sample from the error process - trim them and you destroy the sole estimator of the archive's own error rate while making it look cleaner.",
 "_how_to_use": "Join on (station, month, variable). Any consumer may exclude flagged values, but should state that it did and which flags it honoured.",
