  "beyond_chemistry": "Class 1, NOT flagged per value and counted only. Beyond the plausible band but explicable - bloom supersaturation, sensor zero offset at anoxia. Median of the oxygen band is 16.2 mg/l. EXCLUDING THESE IS NOT DEFENSIBLE: they are mostly real."
